ight and width are specified. If only one attribute is specified, the image should be scaled","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"proportionally to fit in the specified dimension.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLImage.Attributes","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlimage\/attributes-swift.struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Attributes","kind":"identifier"}]}}}